  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Platform\'s Architecture**\n\nI\'m deep in the weeds, architecting **ARGUS CRIMINAL INTEL**. The focus is on the core application. I\'m taking the HTML and CSS snippets, design system components, typography, and color palettes provided, and using them to define and build the key screens. I am prioritizing a robust framework.\n\n\n**Building the Command Center**\n\nI\'ve moved on to the Command Center view. The layout is set: left sidebar, top nav, metrics bar, interactive network graph, priority intelligence panel, and an active investigations table. The focus now is on implementing the dynamic data displays, especially the interactive graph and the real-time updates. I\'m prioritizing performance and responsiveness.\n\n\n**Detailing the Investigation Screens**\n\nI\'m now focused on the specifics of the investigation screens, starting with the investigations list and the case investigation screen, designing with the layout and key elements in mind, such as the case ID badge, status indicators, and sub-tabs like Overview and Evidence. I\'m prioritizing clarity and efficiency in data presentation. I\'ve begun to define the components for the left and right columns, mapping out data visualization.\n\n\n**Developing the Active Alerts**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in developing the Active Alerts and AI Copilot screen. I\'m focusing on the live intelligence stream on the left, integrating real-time alerts with filter and acknowledgement features. On the right, the interactive AI Copilot chat pane, complete with terminal icon and contextual data, is getting refined, including query chips and supporting evidence citations.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 504324540
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
